hadiths[45]{hadithnumber,text}:
"190","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Musalman jab Madina mein aaye to waqt ka andaza kar ke jama ho kar namaz padh liya kartay thay aur koi shakhs nida waghera nahi karta. Aik din Musalmanon ne mashwara kiya ke ittila-e-namaz ke liye Isaiyon ki tarah naqoos baja liya karein ya Yahudiyon ki tarah narsinga baja liya karein to Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne mashwara diya ke aik aadmi ko muqarrar kar diya jaye jo logon ko namaz ke liye muttala kar diya karay. Us par Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Bilal! Utho aur namaz ke liye ailaan kar do. (Muslim). Baab: Azaan ki sifat."
"191","[AI-translation] Abu Mahzoora (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein is tarah azaan sikhayi hai: Allahu Akbar. Allahu Akbar. Baaqi riwayaton mein Allahu Akbar chaar martaba hai. Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah. Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah. Ashhadu anna Muhammadar Rasoolullah. Ashhadu anna Muhammadar Rasoolullah. Phir dobara kahay: Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah. Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah. Ashhadu anna Muhammadar Rasoolullah. Ashhadu anna Muhammadar Rasoolullah. Hayya alas salaah. Do martaba. Hayya alal falaah. Do martaba. Ishaq ka bayan hai ke us ke baad Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar. La ilaha illallah kahay. (Muslim). Baab: Azaan shafa aur iqamat witr karo. (Muslim mein aksar usool mein Allahu Akbar do baar hai, Abu Dawood mein chaar baar hai jo sahih hai; awaz buland karna tarjee hai.)"
"192","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) ko azaan ke alfaaz do do martaba aur iqamat ke alfaaz aik aik martaba kehnay ka hukm kiya gaya. Aur Yahya ne Ibn Ulayya se ye izafa kiya hai ke main ne usay Ayyub se poocha to unhon ne kaha ke iqamat mein sirf qad qaamatis salaah ke alfaaz do martaba kahay jayein. (Muslim)"
"193","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke do muazzin thay. Aik Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) aur doosray Abdullah bin Umm Maktoom (raziyallahu anhu), jo ke nabina thay. (Muslim). Baab: Nabina muazzin rakhna."
"194","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umm Maktoom (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye azaan diya kartay thay aur wo nabina thay. (Muslim). Baab: Azaan ki fazilat."
"195","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) subah sawairay hi dushmanon par hamla kartay thay aur azaan ki aawaz par kaan lagaye rakhtay thay, agar, mukhalifon ke sheher se, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko azaan ki aawaz sunayi deti, to un par hamla na kartay thay. Aik martaba aik shakhs ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar kehtay suna to farmaya ke ye Musalman hai. Us ke baad Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah, Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah kehtay suna to irshad farmaya ke Ae shakhs tu ne dozakh se nijaat paayi. Logon ne dekha to wo bakriyon ka charwaha tha. (Muslim)"
"196","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab azaan hoti hai to shaitaan peeth mor ke gauz, yani paad, maarta hua bhaag jata hai taake azaan na sun sakay aur azaan ke baad phir laut aata hai aur jab takbeer, iqamat, kahi jati hai to phir bhaag khara hota hai aur takbeer, iqamat, ke baad phir wapas aa jata hai aur aadmi ke dil mein waswasay daalta hai aur us ko wo wo baatein yaad dilata hai jo namaz se pehle us shakhs ke khayal mein bhi na thin. Jis ka nateeja ye nikalta hai ke namazi ko yaad hi nahi rehta ke us ne kitni rakatein padhi hain. (Muslim). Baab: Muazzinon ki fazilat. (Tasweeb se murad iqamat hai.)"
"197","[AI-translation] Isa bin Talha kehtay hain ke main Muawiya bin Abu Sufyan (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas tha ke itnay mein unhein muazzin namaz ke liye bulanay aaya. Jis par Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna hai ke qayamat ke din muazzinon ki gardan sab se zyada lambi ho gi. (Muslim). Baab: Jo muazzin kahay wohi kahnay ki fazilat."
"198","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye farmatay hue suna ke jab tum muazzin ki azaan suno to wohi kaho jo muazzin kehta hai, phir mujh par durood padho kyunke jo koi mujh par durood padhta hai, Allah Taala us par apni das rehmatein naazil farmata hai. Us ke baad Allah Taala se mere liye waseela maango. Aur waseela jannat mein aik maqam hai jo Allah ke bandon mein se aik banda ko diya jaye ga aur mujhe umeed hai ke wo banda main hi hun ga. Aur jo koi mere liye waseela, maqam-e-mehmood yani jannat ka aik mehal, talab karay ga to us ke liye meri shafaat wajib ho jaye gi. (Muslim)"
"199","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab muazzin Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar kahay to sunnay wala bhi yehi alfaaz dohraye aur jab wo Ashhadu an la ilaha illallah aur Ashhadu anna Muhammadar Rasoolullah kahay to sunnay wala bhi yehi alfaaz kahay aur jab muazzin Hayya alas salaah kahay to sunnay wala la haula wa la quwwata illa billah kahay phir jab muazzin Hayya alal falaah kahay to sunnay wala bhi la haula wa la quwwata illa billah kahay. Us ke baad muazzin jab Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar aur La ilaha illallah kahay to sunnay walay ko bhi yehi alfaaz dohrana chahiye aur jab sunnay walay ne is tarah khuloos aur dil se yaqeen rakh kar kaha to wo jannat mein daakhil hua, basharteke arkaan-e-Islam ka bhi paband ho. (Muslim)"
"200","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne muazzin ki azaan sun kar ye kaha ke main is baat ki gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi doosra mabood nahi hai, Allah Taala yakta hai aur us ka koi shareek nahi aur Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Allah ke banday aur Rasool hain, main Allah ki raboobiyat aur Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki risalat se masroor aur khush hun aur main ne mazhab-e-Islam ko qabool kar liya hai to aisay shakhs ke gunah maaf kar diye jatay hain. (Muslim). Baab: Farz namaz."
"201","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kuch poochnay ki mumaniat kar di gayi thi to hamein acha maloom hota ke dehaat mein rehnay walon mein se koi aqalmand shakhs aaye aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochay aur ham sunein, to dehaat mein rehnay walon mein se aik shakhs aaya aur kehnay laga ke Ae Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Aap ka ailchi hamaray paas aaya aur kehnay laga ke Aap kehtay hain ke Aap ko Allah ne bheja hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ailchi ne sach kaha. Wo shakhs bola to aasmaan kis ne paida kiya? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne, us ne kaha ke zameen kis ne paida ki? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ne, phir us ne kaha ke paharon ko kis ne khara kiya aur un mein jo cheezein hain wo kis ne paida kein? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya Allah ne, tab us shakhs ne kaha ke qasam hai us zaat ki jis ne aasmaan ko paida kiya aur zameen banayi aur paharon ko khara kiya, kya sach much Allah Taala ne hi Aap ko bheja hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya haan. Phir wo shakhs bola ke Aap ke ailchi ne kaha ke ham par har din aur raat mein paanch namazein farz hain, Aap ne farmaya ke us ne sach kaha. Wo shakhs bola ke qasam hai us ki jis ne Aap ko bheja hai kya Allah ne Aap ko in namazon ka hukm diya hai? Aap ne farmaya haan. Phir wo shakhs bola ke Aap ke ailchi ne kaha ke ham par hamaray maalon ki zakaat hai, Aap ne farmaya ke us ne sach kaha. Wo shakhs bola ke qasam us ki jis ne Aap ko bheja hai, kya Allah ne Aap ko zakaat ka hukm kiya hai? Aap ne farmaya haan. Phir wo shakhs bola ke Aap ke ailchi ne kaha ke ham par saal mein Ramazan ke rozay farz hain, Aap ne farmaya ke us ne sach kaha. Wo shakhs bola ke qasam us ki jis ne Aap ko bheja hai kya Allah ne Aap ko in rozon ka hukm kiya hai? Aap ne farmaya haan. Phir wo shakhs bola ke Aap ke ailchi ne kaha ke ham mein se jo koi raah chalnay ki taqat rakhay, yani kharch-e-raah aur sawaari ho aur rastay mein aman ho us waqt, us par Baitullah ka hajj farz hai, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ne sach kaha. Ye sun kar wo shakhs peeth mor kar chala aur kehnay laga ke qasam hai us ki jis ne Aap ko sacha paighambar kar ke bheja hai, main in baaton se zyada karun ga aur na hi kam. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke agar ye sacha hai to jannat mein jaye ga. (Muslim)"
"202","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke namaz hazar mein bhi aur safar mein bhi do do rakat farz ki gayi thi, phir safar ki namaz to waisi hi rahi aur hazar ki namaz barha di gayi. Zuhri, rawi, ne kaha ke main ne Urwa (raziyallahu anhu) se poocha ke Aisha (raziyallahu anha) safar mein poori namaz kyun padhti thin? Yani un ke nazdeek to do hi rakat farz thin. Tab unhon ne kaha ke Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne wohi taweel ki jo Usman (raziyallahu anhu) ne ki thi, yani safar mein qasr karna rukhsat hai aur poori padhna jaaiz hai. (Muslim: 1/...). Baab: Paanchon namazein darmiyani gunaahon ka kaffara."
"203","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Paanchon namazein aur Juma, Juma tak beech ke gunaahon ka kaffara hain jab tak kabeera gunah na karay aur aik riwayat mein hai ke Ramazan, Ramazan tak kaffara hai un gunaahon ka jo us ke beech mein hon, jab tak kabeera gunah na karay. (Muslim). Baab: Namaz chhorna kufr hai."
"204","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye farmatay hue suna ke, momin, aadmi aur kufr o shirk ke darmiyan, namaz chhornay ka farq hai. (Muslim: 1/62). Baab: Mawaqeet ka jama."
"205","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Zohar ka waqt sooraj dhalnay se shuru hota hai aur aadmi ka saya us ki lambayi ke barabar honay tak, jab tak ke Asr ka waqt na aaye rehta hai. Aur Asr ka waqt tab tak rehta hai ke aaftab zard na ho aur waqt Maghrib jab tak rehta hai ke shafaq ghaib na ho aur waqt Isha ka jab tak rehta hai ke beech ki aadhi raat na ho aur waqt namaz-e-Fajr ka tuloo-e-fajr se jab tak hai ke aaftab na niklay. Phir jab aaftab nikal aaye to namaz se ruka rahay, is liye ke wo shaitaan ke donon seengon ke darmiyan se nikalta hai. (Muslim)"
"206","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki khidmat mein aik saail haazir hua aur namaz ke auqaat poochnay laga. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us waqt kuch jawab na diya, is liye ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko kar ke batana manzoor tha. Phir, Fajr ke waqt, Bilal ko, iqamat ka, hukm diya aur Fajr tuloo honay ke saath hi namaz-e-Fajr ada ki aur log aik doosray ko pehchantay na thay, yani andheray ke sabab se. Phir hukm kiya aur Zohar ada ki jab aaftab dhal gaya aur kehnay wala kehta tha ke din ka aadha hissa guzar gaya hai, yani abhi to dopahar hai, aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sab se behtar jantay thay. Phir un ko hukm kiya aur Asr ki namaz ada ki aur sooraj buland tha. Phir un ko hukm kiya aur Maghrib ada ki jab sooraj doob gaya. Phir un ko hukm kiya aur Isha ada ki jab shafaq doob gayi. Phir doosray din Fajr ka hukm kiya aur jab us se farigh hue to kehnay wala kehta tha ke sooraj nikal aaya, ya nikalnay ko hai. Phir Zohar mein takheer ki yahan tak ke kal ke Asr ke padhnay ka waqt qareeb ho gaya. Phir Asr mein takheer ki yahan tak ke jab farigh hue to kehnay wala kehta tha ke aaftab surkh ho gaya. Phir Maghrib mein takheer ki yahan tak ke shafaq doobnay ke qareeb ho gayi. Phir Isha mein takheer ki yahan tak ke awwal sulus raat ho gayi. Phir subah hui aur saail ko bulaya aur farmaya ke namaz ke waqt in donon waqton ke beech mein hain. (Muslim). (Muslim mein fa amara Bilalan nahi hai.)"
"207","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Amr kehtay hain ke jab Hajjaj Madina mein aaya to ham ne Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se, auqaat-e-namaz ke mutaliq, poocha to unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Zohar ki namaz dopahar ke waqt aur nihayat garmi mein, yani baad zawaal ke, padha kartay thay aur Asr aisay waqt mein padha kartay thay ke aaftab saaf hota aur Maghrib jab aaftab doob jata, phir padhtay aur Isha mein kabhi takheer kartay aur kabhi awwal waqt padhtay. Jab dekhtay ke log jama ho gaye hain to awwal waqt padhtay aur jab dekhtay ke logon ne aanay mein dair ki hai, to dair kartay aur subah ki namaz andheray mein ada kartay thay. (Muslim). Baab: Subah aur Asr ki namaz ki hifazat."
"208","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Imara bin Ruaiba apne walid Imara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain, unhon ne kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye farmatay hue suna ke wo shakhs kabhi dozakh mein daakhil na ho ga jis ne tuloo-e-aaftab se pehle aur gharoob-e-aaftab se pehle ki namaz ada ki, yani Fajr aur Asr ki. Basra walon mein se aik shakhs ne kaha ke tum ne us ko Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha haan. Us ne kaha ke main bhi gawahi deta hun ke main ne bhi us ko Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai. Us, baat, ko mere kaanon ne suna aur mere dil ne yaad rakha hai. Zaahir hai ke jo ye mushkil namazein padhta hai to baaqi namazon ko bhi zaroor padhay ga. (Muslim)"
"209","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Abu Musa Ashari apne walid Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs do thandi namazein padh le ga, wo jannat mein daakhil ho ga. (Muslim). Baab: Tuloo aur gharoob par namaz se mumaniat."
"210","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Asr ke baad ki do rakatein kabhi nahi chhorein. Rawi kehta hai ke Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Khaas kar apni namazon ko tuloo aur gharoob-e-aaftab ke waqt padhnay ki aadat mat karo ke hamesha usi waqt ada kiya karo. Yani Fajr aur Asr takheer se nahi balke awwal waqt mein padho. (Muslim). (Muhammad bin Amr se murad Muhammad bin Amr bin Hasan bin Ali hain; wajabat se murad doobna hai.)"
"211","[AI-translation] Khabbab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki khidmat mein aaye aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, jhulsa denay wali, sakht garmi ki, shikayat ki to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qabool na farmayi. Zuhair ne kaha ke main ne Abu Ishaq se poocha ke Zohar ki namaz ki shikayat ki thi? Unhon ne kaha haan. Main ne kaha ke awwal waqt namaz ada karnay ki? Unhon ne kaha haan. Yani kuch takheer karnay ka mutaliba kiya tha jo ke ibtida mein Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qabool na farmaya aur baad mein us ki ijazat de di, jaisay agli hadees mein hai. (Muslim). Baab: Sakht garmi mein namaz thandi karna."
"212","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke muazzin ne Zohar ki azaan kehnay ka irada kiya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke zara thanda honay do, zara thanda honay do ya farmaya ke zara intezar karo zara intezar karo. Aur farmaya ke garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhaap se hai. Phir jab garmi shiddat ki ho to namaz ko thanday waqt ada karo. Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke yahan tak intezar kiya ke ham ne teelon ke saaye dekh liye. (Muslim). Baab: Asr ka awwal waqt."
"213","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Asr ki namaz padhtay thay aur sooraj buland hota tha aur us mein garmi hoti thi. Aur janay wala oonchay kinaron tak jata tha aur wahan pahunch jata tha aur aaftab, abhi, buland rehta tha. (Muslim)"
"214","[AI-translation] Ala bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke wo Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ke han Basra walay ghar Zohar padh kar gaye aur Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ka ghar masjid ke paas tha. Phir jab ham un ke yahan gaye to unhon ne kaha ke tum Asr padh chukay? Ham ne kaha ke ham to abhi Zohar padh kar aaye hain. Unhon ne kaha ke Asr padh lo. Phir ham ne Asr padhi. Jab Asr padh chukay to unhon ne kaha ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke ye namaz munafiq ki hai ke baitha sooraj ko dekhta hai, phir jab wo shaitaan ke donon seengon mein ho jata hai to uth kar chaar thongein maarta hai aur us mein Allah ko yaad nahi karta magar thora. (Muslim: 2/110). Baab: Asr ki hifazat aur us ke baad namaz se mumaniat."
"215","[AI-translation] Abu Basra Ghifari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamaray saath Asr ki namaz, maqam, Mukhammas mein padhi aur farmaya ke ye namaz tum se pehlon ke saamnay pesh ki gayi aur unhon ne us ko zaya kiya. Phir jo us ki hifazat karay, us ko dogna sawab ho ga aur us ke baad koi namaz nahi jab tak ke shahid na niklay. Aur shahid se murad sitara hai, ke sitara nikal aaye. (Muslim: 2/208). (Mukhammas maroof maqam hai; lam yazal shikayat se murad hai.)"
"216","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis shakhs ki Asr ki namaz faut ho jaye, goya us ka ahal aur maal halaak ho gaya. (Muslim). Baab: Namaz-e-wusta ke baaray mein."
"217","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko namaz-e-Asr se mushrikon ne rok diya, yahan tak ke sooraj surkh ya zard ho gaya. Pas Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke unhon ne hamein namaz-e-Asr, namaz-e-wusta se rok diya hai, Allah un ke paiton aur qabron ko aag se bhar de. (Muslim). Baab: Asr aur Fajr ke baad namaz se mumaniat."
"218","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Asr ke baad sooraj gharoob honay tak aur subah ki namaz ke baad sooraj tuloo honay tak, nafl, namaz padhnay se mana farmaya hai. (Muslim). Baab: Teen auqaat jin mein namaz aur dafan mana hai."
"219","[AI-translation] Ala bin Rabah kehtay hain ke main ne Uqba bin Amir Juhani (raziyallahu anhu) ko ye kehtay hue suna ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamein teen auqaat mein namaz se aur murdon ko dafan karnay se roktay thay. Aik to jab sooraj tuloo ho raha ho, yahan tak ke buland ho jaye, doosray jis waqt theek dopahar ho, jab tak ke zawaal na ho jaye aur teesray jis waqt sooraj doobnay lagay, jab tak poora doob na jaye. (Muslim). Baab: Asr ke baad ki do rakaton ke baaray mein."
"220","[AI-translation] Abu Salama ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se un do rakaton ke baaray mein poocha jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Asr ke baad padhtay thay, to unhon ne kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Asr se pehle padha kartay thay, phir aik baar Aap ko koi kaam ho gaya ya bhool gaye to Asr ke baad padhein phir hamesha padhtay rahay aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aadat thi ke jab koi namaz padhtay to hamesha padha kartay thay. Ismail bin Jafar ne kaha ke un ki murad ye thi ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us par hamesha-gi ki. (Muslim). (Tameel se murad jhukna hai.)"
"221","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) jang-e-Khandaq ke din aaye aur kuffar-e-Quraish ko bura bhala kehnay lagay aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Qasam hai Allah ki main Asr ki namaz nahi padh saka hun, yahan tak ke aaftab gharoob ke qareeb ho gaya hai. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke qasam hai Allah ki main ne bhi nahi padhi. Phir ham aik kankareeli zameen ki taraf gaye aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wuzu kiya aur ham sab ne wuzu kiya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne gharoob-e-aaftab ke baad Asr ki namaz padhi, phir us ke baad Maghrib ki namaz padhi. (Muslim: 2/113). Baab: Gharoob ke baad Maghrib se pehle ki do rakatein."
"222","[AI-translation] Mukhtar bin Falfal kehtay hain ke main ne Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Asr ke baad nafl padhnay ke baaray mein poocha to unhon ne kaha ke Umar (raziyallahu anhu) Asr ke baad namaz padhnay walon ke haathon par maartay thay aur ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke daur mein gharoob-e-aaftab ke baad namaz Maghrib se pehle do rakat padhtay thay. Main ne un se kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bhi ye do rakatein padha kartay thay? Unhon ne kaha ke ham ko padhtay hue dekha kartay thay aur na us ka hukm kartay, yani batreeq-e-wujoob ke, aur na us se mana farmatay thay. (Muslim). Baab: Maghrib ka waqt jab sooraj doob jaye."
"223","[AI-translation] Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamesha Maghrib ki namaz us waqt padha kartay thay jab aaftab doob jata aur pardah mein chhup jata tha. (Muslim). Baab: Isha ki namaz ka waqt aur us mein takheer."
"224","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik raat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne namaz-e-Isha mein dair ki, yahan tak ke raat ka bara hissa guzar gaya aur masjid mein jo log thay so gaye. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) niklay, namaz padhi aur farmaya ke agar mujhe ye khayal na hota ke main apni ummat par mashaqqat daal dun ga, us ka waqt yehi hai. (Muslim). Baab: Isha ki namaz ke naam ke baaray mein."
"225","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Dehati log tum par Isha ki namaz ke naam par ghalib na aa jayein, is liye ke wo Allah ki kitab mein Isha hai. Is liye ke wo oontniyon ke dohnay mein dair kartay hain. Is liye wo namaz-e-Isha ko atma kehtay hain. (Muslim)"
"226","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke tum kya karo ge jab tumharay upar aisay ameer hon ge to namaz aakhir waqt ada karein ge ya farmaya ke namaz ko us ke waqt se maar daalein ge? Main ne arz kiya ke Aap mujhe kya hukm farmatay hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne waqt par ada kar lena, phir un ke saath bhi ittifaq ho to padh lena ke wo tumharay liye nafl ho jaye gi. (Muslim). Baab: Afzal amal namaz apne waqt par."
"227","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha ke kaun sa kaam afzal hai? Yani sawab mein sab se barh kar hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke namaz apne waqt par padhna. Main ne kaha ke phir kaun sa? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke maan baap se neki karna, yani un ko khush aur raazi rakhna aur un ke saath ehsaan karna aur un ke doston ke saath bhi acha sulook karna. Main ne kaha ke phir kaun sa? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki raah mein jihad karna. Phir main ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki riayat kar ke zyada poochna chhor diya, taake Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par baar na guzray. (Muslim). Baab: Jis ne namaz ki aik rakat paayi us ne namaz paayi."
"228","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne kisi namaz ki aik rakat paa li us ne wo namaz paa li. (Muslim). Baab: Jo namaz se so jaye ya bhool jaye to jab yaad aaye padhay."
"229","[AI-translation] Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein khitaab kartay hue farmaya: Tum aaj zawaal ke baad aur apni saari raat chalo agar Allah ne chaha to kal subah pani par pahuncho ge. Pas log is tarah chalay ke koi kisi ki taraf mutawajjah na hota tha. Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) chalay jatay thay, yahan tak ke aadhi raat ho gayi aur main Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke pehlu ki taraf tha aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) oonghnay lagay aur apni sawaari par se jhukay, yani neend ke ghalba se, aur main ne aa kar Aap ko teka diya, taake gir na parein, baghair us ke ke main Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jagaun, yahan tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) phir seedhay ho kar baith gaye. Phir chalay yahan tak ke jab bohat raat guzar gayi, phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jhukay aur main ne phir teka diya baghair us ke ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jagaun, yahan tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) phir seedhay ho kar baith gaye. Phir chalay yahan tak ke aakhir sehar ka waqt ho gaya, phir aik baar bohat jhukay ke aglay do baar se bhi zyada, qareeb tha ke gir parein. Phir main aaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko rok diya. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sar uthaya aur farmaya ye kaun hai? Main ne arz kiya ke Abu Qatada. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum kab se mere saath is tarah chal rahay ho? Main ne arz kiya ke main raat se Aap ke saath isi tarah chal raha hun. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala tumhari hifazat karay jaisay tum ne us ke Nabi ki hifazat ki hai. Phir Aap ne farmaya ke tum hamein dekhtay ho ke ham logon ki nazron mein posheeda hain? Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum kisi ko dekhtay ho? Main ne kaha ke ye aik sawaar hai, phir main ne kaha ke ye aik aur sawaar hai, yahan tak ke ham saat sawaar jama ho gaye. Tab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) raah se aik taraf alag hue aur apna sar zameen par rakha, yani sonay ko, aur farmaya ke tum log hamari namaz ka khayal rakhna, yani namaz ke waqt jaga dena. Phir pehle jo jagay wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hi thay aur dhoop Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki peeth par aa gayi thi. Phir ham log ghabra kar uthay aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke sawaar ho jao to ham sawaar hue. Phir chalay yahan tak ke jab dhoop charh gayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) utray, apna wuzu ka lota mangwaya jo mere paas tha aur us mein thora sa pani tha, phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se wuzu kiya, jo aam wuzu se kam tha yani bohat qaleel pani se bohat jald, aur us mein thora sa pani baaqi reh gaya. Phir Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya ke hamaray lotay ko rakh chhoro ke us ki aik ajeeb kaifiyat ho gi. Phir Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) ne namaz ke liye azaan kahi aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne do rakat namaz padhi, phir subah ki farz namaz ada ki aur waisay hi ada ki jaisay har roz ada kartay thay. Aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bhi aur ham bhi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath sawaar hue, phir ham mein se baaz doosray se chupkay chupkay kehta tha ke aaj hamaray is qasoor ka kya kaffara ho ga jo ham ne namaz mein qasoor kiya. Tab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kya main tum logon ke liye uswa nahi hun? Phir farmaya ke sonay mein kya qasoor hai? Qasoor to ye hai ke aik aadmi namaz na padhay, yahan tak ke doosri namaz ka waqt aa jaye, yani jagtay mein qaza karay. Phir jo aisa karay, yani us ki qaza ho jaye to, lazim hai ke jab hoshiyar ho, ada karay. Aur jab doosra din aaye to apni namaz auqaat-e-mutayyana par ada karay, yani ye nahi ke aik baar qaza ho janay se namaz ka waqt hi badal jaye. Phir farmaya ke tum kya khayal kartay ho ke logon ne kya kya ho ga? Phir farmaya ke logon ne jab subah ki to apne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko na paya. Tab Abu Bakr aur Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tumharay peechay hon ge, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aisay nahi ke tumhein peechay chhor jayein aur doosray logon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tum se aagay hain. Phir wo log agar Abu Bakr aur Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ki baat mantay to seedhi raah patay, ye khabar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne muajiza ke taur par di. Rawi ne kaha ke phir ham logon tak pahunchay, yahan tak ke din kaafi charh aaya tha aur har cheez garam ho gayi thi aur log kehnay lagay ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Ham to mar gaye aur pyasay ho gaye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya nahi tum nahi maray. Phir farmaya ke hamara chota pyala lao aur wo lota mangwaya aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) pani daalnay lagay aur Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) logon ko pani pilanay lagay. Phir jab logon ne dekha ke pani aik lota bhar hi hai to log us par girnay lagay, yani har shakhs darnay laga ke pani thora hai kahin mehroom na reh jaun. Tab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke achi tarah aahistagi se letay raho, tum sab sairaab ho jao ge. Gharz ke phir log itminan se lenay lagay aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) pani daaltay thay aur main pilata tha yahan tak ke mere aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke siwa koi baaqi na raha, rawi ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne phir daala aur mujh se farmaya ke piyo! Main ne arz kiya ke main na piyun ga jab tak Allah ke Rasool Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) na piyen ge. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke qaum ka pilanay wala sab ke aakhir mein peeta hai. Phir main ne piya, rawi ne kaha ke phir log pani par khush khush aur aasooda pahunchay. Rawi ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Rabah ne kaha ke main jama masjid mein logon se yehi hadees bayan karta tha ke Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae jawan ghaur karo ke tum kya kehtay ho, is liye ke main us raat ka aik sawaar tha. Kehtay hain ke main ne kaha phir to Aap is hadees se khoob waaqif hon ge. Unhon ne kaha ke tum kis qaum se ho? Main ne kaha main Ansaar mein se hun. Unhon ne kaha bayan karo ke tum to apni hadeeson ko khoob jantay ho. Phir main ne logon se poori riwayat bayan ki. Tab Imran (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main bhi us raat haazir tha magar main nahi janta ke jaisa tum ne yaad rakha aisa aur kisi ne yaad rakha ho. (Muslim). (Ibhaarra se murad aadhi raat hona hai; Muslim mein janbahu hai; tahawwara se murad raat ka zyada hissa guzarna hai; yanjafilu se murad girna hai.)"
"230","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik shakhs ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha ke kya aik kapray mein namaz durust hai? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum mein se har shakhs ke paas do do kapray hain? (Muslim). Baab: Naqsh daar kapray mein namaz."
"231","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abu Salama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Umm Salama ke ghar aik kapra lapaitay hue namaz padh rahay thay aur us ke donon kinaray Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke mondhon par thay. (Muslim). Baab: Chataayi par namaz."
"232","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik naqsh o nigaar wali chaadar orh kar namaz padhnay ke liye kharay hue to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke nishanon ki taraf dekhnay lagay. Jab namaz padh chukay to farmaya ke us chaadar ko Abu Jahm bin Huzaifa ke paas le jao aur un ki chaadar, jo ke baghair naqsh o nigaar ke thi, mujhe la do kyunke us chaadar ne mujhe abhi namaz mein ghafil kar diya. (Muslim). Baab: Chataayi par jamaat."
"233","[AI-translation] Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abu Talha se Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un, Anas (raziyallahu anhu), ki daadi ne jin ka naam Mulaika tha, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko aik khanay ke liye bulaya jo unhon ne pakaya tha. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khaya aur farmaya: Kharay ho jao ke main, tumhari khair o barkat ke liye, namaz padhun. Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main aik, chataayi, boriya le kar khara hua jo bohat bichhanay se siyah ho gaya tha, yani mustaamal tha, us par main ne pani chhiraka aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us par kharay hue aur main ne aur aik yateem ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechay saf baandhi aur boorhi bhi hamaray peechay khari hui, phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne do rakat namaz padhayi aur salam phera. (Muslim: 2/127). Baab: Jooton mein namaz."
"234","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Yazid kehtay hain ke main ne Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha ke kya Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jootay pehan kar namaz padhtay thay? Unhon ne kaha haan. (Muslim). Baab: Zameen par pehli masjid."
